cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "FORGE EVOLVE for TMPC: AI-Assisted Modernization of C#/.NET Mission-Planning Software"
abstract: >-
  A reviewer-runnable C#/.NET reference implementation of the FORGE EVOLVE code-modernization
  framework, extended to the Theater Mission Planning Center (TMPC) software stack
  (C#/.NET, JavaScript, SQL, VB6). Demonstrates AI-assisted legacy code discovery, refactoring,
  behavioral-equivalence validation with mission-data-aware oracles, and continuous-ATO artifact
  generation on a synthetic, unclassified Mission-Distribution-System-like surrogate component.
  Developed under U.S. Navy SBIR topic DON26BZ01-NV013.
